<subpara id="RM000000FSN00TX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___000046S00000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<step1>
<ptxt>TaSCAN ECU Data Monitor</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>For subtle symptoms such as hesitation or rough idle, it is necessary to use a method of collecting data from a vehicle of the same model under the same conditions and comparing it, and make an overall judgment from all items of computer data.</ptxt>
</atten3>
<step2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), display the [ECU Data Monitor] screen according to the screen display, and check the computer data.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
